{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7536703012961","title":"Ivory Cascade Mommy and Me Set - Sleeveless Top & Maxi Skirt","handle":"ivory-cascade-mommy-and-me-set","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-24T04:08:27Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/ivory-cascade-mommy-and-me-set","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven fabric with a softly crinkled texture and an airy drape for warm-weather matching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A soft ivory mom-and-daughter look made for vacations, birthday photos, garden parties, and easy summer afternoons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Ivory Cascade\" keeps the palette bright and elegant with a gathered sleeveless top and a flowing maxi skirt in soft ivory.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Sleeveless gathered neckline, asymmetric peplum-style top hem, elastic-waist skirt, and easy movement through every step and twirl.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and use a cool iron on the reverse if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 1-2 Years to Child 9-10 Years; Mother S to Mother L.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Top &amp; Skirt Set</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Sleeve or Skirt (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>9-11.5 kg / 19.8-25.4 lbs</td>\n<td>75-85 cm / 29.5-33.5 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>38 cm / 15.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>42 cm / 16.5 in</td>\n<td>35 cm / 13.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>12-14.5 kg / 26.