 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>58-62.5 kg / 127.9-137.8 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>63-69.5 kg / 138.9-153.2 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Ivory Cascade Mommy and Me Set brings a light, graceful feel to matching-moment dressing. The softly gathered sleeveless top skims away from the body with an easy ruffle shape, while the long flowing skirt adds movement that feels polished enough for family photos and relaxed enough for all-day summer plans.</p>\n\n<p>From beachside strolls to birthday lunches and travel snapshots, this two-piece look keeps styling simple without losing that dressed-up charm. The solid ivory tone feels fresh and elevated, and the top-and-skirt pairing makes the outfit feel airy, twirl-friendly, and easy to accessorize with sandals, bows, and woven bags.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy two-piece silhouette:</strong> The sleeveless top and flowing skirt feel light, comfortable, and warm-weather ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft gathered neckline:</strong> A smooth gathered neckline keeps the look polished while staying easy to wear.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flowing maxi skirt:</strong> A long skirt adds movement and a photo-ready finish for vacations and special outings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy elastic waist:</strong> The skirt waistband helps keep the fit comfortable for both mom and mini.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini coordination:</strong> Both roles share the same elegant ivory outfit story for effortless twinning.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home an ivory mommy-and-me set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Child 1-2yr","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Cream","Dresses","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1030397527808.html","Ivory","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Maxi Skirt","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Resort","Ruffle Top","Skirt Set","Sleeveless Dress","Summer","Summer Dresses","Sundresses","Two-Piece Set","Vacation","White"],"seo":{"title":"Ivory Cascade Mommy & Me Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight woven mommy-and-me set with a sleeveless ruffle top and flowing skirt for mom + daughter. Sizes 1-2Y-10Y and Mom S-L."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Outfit Sets"},"options":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9617518919777","name":"Size","position":1,"values":["Child 1-2 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Mother S","Mother M","Mother L"],"optionValues":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660613217","name":"Child 1-2 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660252769","name":"Child 2 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660285537","name":"Child 3 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660318305","name":"Child 4 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660351073","name":"Child 5 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660383841","name":"Child 6-7 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660416609","name":"Child 8 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6140660449377","name":"Child 9-10 Years","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOpti